    "objects": [
        {
            "objclass": "LevelDefinition",
            "objdata": {
                "Description": "[PLAYERS_HOUSE]",
                "FirstIntroNarrative": "LEE2_Intro",
                "FirstOutroNarrative": "LEE2_Outro",
                "LevelNumber": 6,
                "Loot": "RTID(NoLoot@LevelModules)",
                "Modules": [
                    "RTID(StandardIntro@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(DefaultSunDropper@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(ZombiesDeadWinCon@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(FrontLawnMowers@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(SeedBank@CurrentLevel)",
                    "RTID(DefaultZombieWinCondition@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(NewWaves@CurrentLevel)",
                    "RTID(ChallengeModule@CurrentLevel)"
                ],
                "WrittenBy": "砹化钫FrAt",
                "NameMultiLanguage": {
                    "en": "Epic Quest: Lawn of Embarkation Escapade!",
                    "zh": "史诗任务：启程草坪的奇遇！"
                },
                "MarkdownMultiLanguage": {
                    "zh": [
                        "## 启程草坪的奇遇：第2天",
                        "> *教程关拓展拓展第二天*",
                        "---",
                        "难度不高，适合作为拓拓系列初印象",
                        "对话要点总结：",
                        "* 每个世界的拓拓第二关都是有两个条件的自选，大部分的第二关出怪量比第一关少",
                        "* 非官方拓展拓展系列关会假设你已经解锁了所有植物，有些关卡可能需要用到你没有获取的植物才能过关",
                        "* 实际关卡可能并不会严格按照`启程草坪的奇遇`介绍的模板设计 - 这个模版只是一个大概参考，并不是严格的要求"
                    ],
                    "en": [
                        "## Lawn of Embarkation Escapade: Day 2",
                        "> *EXpansion Levels for Tutorial Levels - Day 2*",
                        "---",
                        "This level is more instructive than challenging, use this as a first-impression for the Unofficial EXpansion series. ",
                        "Key Points covered in dialogue: ",
                        "* Every level 2 of each world in the Gardendless: Unofficial EXpansion series has two win conditions. Most level 2 has less zombies than level 1",
                        "* The Unofficial EXpansion series expects you to have every plant unlocked, a level could be designed to be completed with a specific plant you might not own!",
                        "* The levels might NOT follow the very format we're introducing in the `LEE` Series - the designers are encouraged to follow the structure, but it is not a must!"
                    ]
                },
                "StageModule": "RTID(TutorialStage@LevelModules)"
            }
        },
        {
            "aliases": [
                "LEE2_Intro"
            ],
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Did you enjoy the last level?",
                            "zh": "上一关打的开心吗？"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I am Ahf_FrAt, one of the two main level designers for the Gardendless: Unofficial EXpansion series =)",
                            "zh": "我是砹化钫FrAt，「GE版：非官方拓展拓展系列关」作者之一"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "In case you don't know, every level 2 of each world in the Gardendless: Unofficial EXpansion series has two win conditions, ",
                            "zh": "以防你不知道，每个世界的拓拓第二关都是有两个条件的自选，"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "which means that in addition to defeating all zombies, you also have to complete the goals to pass the level.",
                            "zh": "也就意味着除了击败所有僵尸之外，还要完成条件才能过关"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Most level 2 has less zombies than level 1... but due to the win conditions, level 2s might not be easier than level 1s.",
                            "zh": "大部分的第二关出怪量比第一关少...但由于胜利条件的限制，第二关并不一定比第一关简单"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Good luck!",
                            "zh": "祝你好运！"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "aliases": [
                "LEE2_Outro"
            ],
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Great job obliterating that level! Hope you liked it......",
                            "zh": "干得好，你打爆了那群僵尸！希望你喜欢这关……"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "......because you might not like the next level, as you will not be choosing plants next time.",
                            "zh": "……因为你不一定会喜欢下一关，下一关可就不会让你选植物了"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "And hey, here's some fun facts: ",
                            "zh": "然后，顺便告诉你几个冷知识："
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "The Unofficial EXpansion series expects you to have every plant unlocked, a level could be designed to be completed with a specific plant you might not own!",
                            "zh": "非官方拓展拓展系列关会假设你已经解锁了所有植物，有些关卡可能需要用到你没有获取的植物才能过关！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Also, the levels might NOT follow the very format we're introducing here - the designers are encouraged to do so, but it is not a must!",
                            "zh": "此外，实际关卡可能并不会严格按照我们介绍的模板设计 - 这个模版只是一个大概参考，并不是严格的要求"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "That's all for now, I'll catch ya in another level =) cya!",
                            "zh": "那就先说这些，另个关卡见 =) 拜拜！"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
